# Runs before the application context exists, which is the only place the
# OAuth2 client registration properties can be *withheld* — see
# AdminOAuthEnvironmentPostProcessor. By the time a @Configuration class could
# look at them, Boot has already bound and rejected a blank client id.
org.springframework.boot.EnvironmentPostProcessor=\
com.omnissa.access.approval.config.AdminOAuthEnvironmentPostProcessor
